        },
        "clause_hTnGUQ": {
          "type": "clause",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "body": "<p>Once your order has been dispatched, you'll receive a confirmation email containing your tracking details.</p><p>Please ensure your delivery address is correct before placing your order. THELACEDWAY cannot be held responsible for delays or failed deliveries caused by incorrect address details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "clause_K9bR83": {
          "type": "clause",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "International Shipping",
            "body": "<p>For orders shipped outside of the United Kingdom, import duties, taxes and customs fees may apply once your parcel reaches its destination country. These charges are determined by your local customs authorities and are the responsibility of the customer.</p><p>THELACEDWAY has no control over these charges, and they are not included in the shipping cost at checkout.</p>"
