        "clause_diB98e": {
          "type": "clause",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Lost, Stolen or Missing Packages",
            "body": "<p>Once your order has been shipped, responsibility for the parcel transfers to the shipping courier. If you believe your package has been lost, stolen or is missing, we recommend contacting the shipping courier directly to open an investigation or submit a claim. THELACEDWAY cannot be held responsible for packages that are lost, stolen or delayed in transit.</p>"
          }
