        "clause_hyk6Q3": {
          "type": "clause",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns & Exchanges",
            "body": "<p>Due to the nature of our products and for hygiene reasons, we are unable to accept returns, exchanges or refunds on any wigs, hair extensions or custom-made products.</p><p>All sales are final.</p><p>If your order arrives damaged or you believe you have received the wrong item, please contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photographs of the issue. We'll investigate and work with you to resolve the matter promptly.</p><p>As our hair is 100% Virgin Human Hair, slight variations in colour, texture and wave pattern may occur. These are natural characteristics of authentic virgin hair and are not considered faults or defects. Each unit is unique while maintaining the same premium quality and longevity.</p>"
